{
  "title": { "zh": "谁是祖父母" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"q-grand\"></level-ref>里，「祖父母」写成了一句查询。这一次它是一条规则：⟦?x是?y的父母; ?y是?z的父母⟧ ⟹ ?x是?z的祖父母。族谱上的事实是目标的已知。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "问题本身带着 ?：「?w是茜的祖父母」。每一种证法里 ?w 是谁，就是一个答案。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "这就是 Prolog：程序是一组规则，提问是证明一个带 ? 的目标。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "pl-grand",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "answers",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "问题" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "rules": {
        "grand": {
          "name": { "zh": "祖父母" },
          "premises": ["Parent(?x, ?y)", "Parent(?y, ?z)"],
          "conclusion": "Grand(?x, ?z)"
        }
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "goal": "Grand(?w, k)",
          "hyps": ["Parent(i, j)", "Parent(j, k)", "Parent(j, l)", "Parent(l, m)", "Parent(n, m)"],
          "answers": ["i"]
        },
        {
          "goal": "Grand(j, ?w)",
          "hyps": ["Parent(i, j)", "Parent(j, k)", "Parent(j, l)", "Parent(l, m)", "Parent(n, m)"],
          "answers": ["m"]
        },
        {
          "goal": "Grand(i, ?w)",
          "hyps": ["Parent(i, j)", "Parent(j, k)", "Parent(j, l)", "Parent(l, m)", "Parent(n, m)"],
          "answers": ["k", "l"]
        }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，找出每个问题的所有答案。" },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "倒着用规则「祖父母」。" },
        { "zh": "每一种对法都是一个答案。" }
      ],
      "solution": ["c0r0 = grand()", "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)", "c1 = assumption(c0)", "c2 = assumption(c1)", "out <- c2"]
    }
  ]
}
